1
00:02:04,300 --> 00:02:06,300
Give him a good beating!

2
00:02:12,300 --> 00:02:18,300
Nothing daunts me! Kill me since
you've got me! I won't complain!

3
00:02:18,300 --> 00:02:23,300
Wu Fuqi! You call him Teacher.
Are you in cahoots with him?

4
00:02:23,900 --> 00:02:27,900
So what if I am? A true man takes
responsibility for everything he does!

5
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:31,900
You're in my hands now.
I'll see what you can do!

6
00:02:32,100 --> 00:02:34,300
I'm not afraid of you, Shi Yaoqian!

7
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:38,300
That does not matter so long as
you're afraid of my punishments

8
00:02:38,300 --> 00:02:40,300
Men, give it to him!

9
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:41,700
Hold it!

10
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:44,900
Golden Swallow?

11
00:02:46,300 --> 00:02:48,900
Please let him off

12
00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:52,100
He collaborated with Joined Brow

13
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:55,300
-You've got it wrong
-I've got it wrong?

14
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:01,300
He's actually my spy

15
00:03:01,300 --> 00:03:02,900
Spy?

16
00:03:04,300 --> 00:03:08,300
I get him to mix with people of
all walks of life so as to...

17
00:03:08,300 --> 00:03:11,900
collect info and catch criminals

18
00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:14,900
What a brilliant idea!

19
00:03:15,300 --> 00:03:17,300
-You get the picture now?
-Yes...

20
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:22,300
I've always found him
rather extraordinary

21
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:24,300
So he's your man.
No wonder

22
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:27,900
-So can I take him away?
-Sure, sure

23
00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:32,300
-Go!
-Where to?

24
00:03:32,300 --> 00:03:34,300
Would you rather stay here?

25
00:03:35,180 --> 00:03:36,300
You traitor!

26
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:40,300
Teacher...

27
00:03:40,300 --> 00:03:41,300
Save your explanation!

28
00:03:41,300 --> 00:03:43,300
I'm not going to let you off!

29
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:45,900
-Come on!
-Don't believe her...

30
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:49,300
You traitor!

31
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:54,900
Why did you say I was your spy?
You were making things up!

32
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:58,300
I had to do that
to make Shi Yaoqian set you free

33
00:03:58,300 --> 00:04:01,300
My teacher has got the wrong idea

34
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:04,300
All the better.
Good riddance to him

35
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:08,300
My foot! Why must you keep
breaking me away from my teacher?

36
00:04:08,300 --> 00:04:13,900
Because of you, I'm now looked upon as
a traitor who's betrayed his teacher

37
00:04:14,100 --> 00:04:20,100
Come on, you cheat, womanize and gamble.
You have no conscience to speak of

38
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:22,100
So why should you mind?

39
00:04:23,300 --> 00:04:24,900
Not bad

40
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:28,300
I won't argue with you.
I'm going home!

41
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:34,300
-I haven't finished!
-I'm not going to listen to you!

42
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:37,100
Let go!

43
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:41,300
You forgot this

44
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:45,900
Please spare me the agony

45
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:50,300
When I was 4, I cheated my mother
of her money to buy sweets

46
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:53,300
When I was 6, I got into a fight
on my first day in school

47
00:04:53,300 --> 00:04:57,100
At 10, I started stealing
from the hawkers in the streets

48
00:04:57,100 --> 00:05:00,300
At 12, I was already an expert
at casting dice

49
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:03,900
For the past 20 odd years,
I've been lying idle

50
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:08,900
Please go and guide someone else.
I beg of you!

51
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:14,900
It's because nobody has disciplined you
all these years you've become a crook

52
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:18,900
That's why all the more I must
take you in hand. Get it?

53
00:05:18,900 --> 00:05:20,900
You're asking for a beating!

54
00:05:21,300 --> 00:05:26,900
I'm helping you but instead of being
grateful, you treat me like an enemy

55
00:05:26,900 --> 00:05:27,900
Keep it!

56
00:05:30,300 --> 00:05:33,300
Please let me off.
Go to Shou

57
00:05:33,300 --> 00:05:36,900
He's filial to his mother.
He'll heed your advice for sure

58
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:41,300
Or go teach Lu. He's learned. He'll
pick up everything you teach instantly

59
00:05:41,300 --> 00:05:45,300
Your 10 Commandments are too noble
for a crook like me

60
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:47,900
Farewell.
I won't see you again!

61
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:52,100
I'll see where you can hide!

62
00:05:59,300 --> 00:06:01,900
-Mother, I'm back
-Oh

63
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:09,300
Is that all? I just came back from
jail and all you said is "oh"

64
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:12,300
Aren't you stupid, son!

65
00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:17,300
Joined Brow robs openly.
If he's caught, he'll be beheaded

66
00:06:17,300 --> 00:06:21,300
But you steal and cheat secretly

67
00:06:21,300 --> 00:06:28,300
You'll never be found out or caught.
It's worth the while

68
00:06:29,300 --> 00:06:32,300
The upper beam being slanted,
the lower beam is crooked too

69
00:06:33,300 --> 00:06:39,300
Who are you? Why are you behaving
rudely in my courtyard?

70
00:06:39,300 --> 00:06:42,900
Spicy woman verses Wily hag.
This is interesting!

71
00:06:43,300 --> 00:06:45,900
Like mother, like son!

72
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:47,900
-Don't insult my mother!
-Don't insult my son!

73
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:51,100
Your hearts beat as one though

74
00:06:54,300 --> 00:06:58,700
How I teach my son is my business.
It's none of your concern!

75
00:06:58,700 --> 00:07:02,300
Precisely, Mother.
A busybody is loathed by all

76
00:07:02,300 --> 00:07:05,300
If he steals and cheats,
I'll have to interfere!

77
00:07:06,300 --> 00:07:11,300
He occasionally steals and cheats to
make some money. That's something good

78
00:07:11,300 --> 00:07:14,900
The fittest survive.
It's the law of the jungle

79
00:07:15,300 --> 00:07:18,900
The victims don't necessarily
have to take the bait

80
00:07:18,900 --> 00:07:22,900
If they do, they can only blame
themselves for being stupid!

81
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:25,300
You actually feel proud of him!

82
00:07:25,300 --> 00:07:29,900
It's no big deal. I run a stall
outside the city god temple

83
00:07:29,900 --> 00:07:35,300
Those officers come every day
to collect protection money

84
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:38,900
And thefts happen in Ping'an Town
every day

85
00:07:39,300 --> 00:07:44,300
This is the way of the world. You have
to be dishonest in order to live

86
00:07:45,300 --> 00:07:47,900
That's why you teach your son
to steal and cheat?

87
00:07:49,300 --> 00:07:54,900
I'm not so capable.
He was born with those abilities

88
00:07:56,900 --> 00:07:58,900
This bangle is nice, isn't it?

89
00:07:59,300 --> 00:08:04,300
My son was clever to dupe Huang-shen
into believing it was a piece of loot

90
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:07,300
She wouldn't have sold it to me
at a low price otherwise!

91
00:08:07,300 --> 00:08:09,300
Don't say any more

92
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:14,900
It's not as if she'd arrest me.
Let me teach her the ways of the world

93
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:16,900
Let me tell you...

94
00:08:16,900 --> 00:08:22,300
She's the lady constable, Ma Ruyi,
who has just arrested Joined Brow

95
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:29,300
-Why didn't you tell me earlier?
-You told me not to interrupt

96
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:37,300
Miss Ma... I mean, Swordswoman,
what brings you over?

97
00:08:38,300 --> 00:08:41,900
I tend to shoot my mouth off.
Please don't take it to heart

98
00:08:43,300 --> 00:08:49,300
Let's cut the formalities out. I'm here
to make a deal with you actually

99
00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:50,300
A deal?

100
00:08:52,300 --> 00:08:55,300
I find your son a talent,
but he lacks discipline

101
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:59,300
Someone needs to do something about him
before he can make big achievements

102
00:08:59,300 --> 00:09:02,300
But I'll need your help
in the initial stage

103
00:09:02,300 --> 00:09:05,300
Just give me the instructions!

104
00:09:06,300 --> 00:09:09,100
There are 10 taels here

105
00:09:09,300 --> 00:09:13,300
You'll keep an eye on Fu. Make sure
he doesn't break these commandments

106
00:09:13,300 --> 00:09:17,900
One tael per commandment.
10 taels for 10 commandments

107
00:09:18,300 --> 00:09:23,300
If you think you can bribe my mother,
then you're wrong

108
00:09:24,300 --> 00:09:30,100
I can't possibly turn down
Miss Ma's kind offer

109
00:09:31,300 --> 00:09:35,300
Just 10 taels and you're bought over.
Aren't you cheap!

110
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:43,300
Rest assured I'll follow
your instructions accordingly!

111
00:09:43,900 --> 00:09:44,900
Thanks!

112
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:47,700
You're really cheap!

113
00:09:49,300 --> 00:09:52,300
She's our benefactress.
Go on your knees!

114
00:09:52,300 --> 00:09:53,300
Why should I?

115
00:09:55,100 --> 00:09:56,300
On your knees!

116
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:03,300
-Come down and walk!
-No!

117
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:05,300
You look just like a snail!

118
00:10:06,900 --> 00:10:08,900
I don't see any lingzhi

119
00:10:10,300 --> 00:10:13,300
Go further up!

120
00:10:14,300 --> 00:10:16,900
You must save some for me!

121
00:10:18,900 --> 00:10:21,900
-Have you heard of Joined Brow?
-Yes

122
00:10:21,900 --> 00:10:25,300
His wife, One Chop, is 10 times
more ferocious than him

123
00:10:25,300 --> 00:10:27,300
She can kill while jumping high

124
00:10:27,300 --> 00:10:31,300
Before you blink, she'll have
chopped you up into pieces

125
00:10:31,300 --> 00:10:33,300
That incredible?

126
00:10:33,300 --> 00:10:38,900
You're lucky. I'll have a duel with her
here. You can see how formidable she is

127
00:10:40,900 --> 00:10:42,900
What's holding her up?

128
00:10:44,300 --> 00:10:47,300
She's crazy! We're not going to
get involved in the duel!

129
00:10:47,300 --> 00:10:48,900
Let's run!

130
00:10:55,300 --> 00:10:57,300
Wow, he's climbed so high up

131
00:10:58,300 --> 00:11:03,900
Hey, where are the bearers?
Where have they gone?

132
00:11:09,300 --> 00:11:12,900
I guess they were too tired.
They left

133
00:11:13,300 --> 00:11:18,300
You told me to look for lingzhi,
and you sent the bearers away

134
00:11:18,300 --> 00:11:20,900
How am I to go home then?

135
00:11:21,300 --> 00:11:26,300
I didn't send them away.
Anyway, we can always walk back

136
00:11:26,300 --> 00:11:29,300
It's such a long distance!
Are you trying to kill me?

137
00:11:29,300 --> 00:11:31,900
What else can we do?
There's nobody else here

138
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:38,900
Get up!
I'm not going to carry you!

139
00:11:39,900 --> 00:11:41,900
Get up!

140
00:12:09,300 --> 00:12:12,100
How did you know I was pretending?

141
00:12:12,100 --> 00:12:18,100
I deal with criminals so I need to have
some intelligence or I'll be killed!

142
00:12:20,300 --> 00:12:21,900
Come back!

143
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:30,300
Carry me!
I can't walk anymore. Carry me!

144
00:12:32,900 --> 00:12:33,900
Hurry...

145
00:12:53,300 --> 00:12:59,300
After duping me into going into the
mountains, she sent the bearers away

146
00:12:59,300 --> 00:13:02,900
I had to walk all the way back

147
00:13:03,900 --> 00:13:09,900
It was such a long distance!
She was obviously trying to kill me!

148
00:13:11,300 --> 00:13:14,300
I see.
She meant well

149
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:21,100
What? After what she did to me,
you still think she meant well?

150
00:13:23,300 --> 00:13:27,100
You should do as she says
and exercise more

151
00:13:28,300 --> 00:13:32,900
What's wrong with you, Mother?
You listen to her but not to me

152
00:13:32,900 --> 00:13:34,900
Uncle, you're not panting today!

153
00:13:37,300 --> 00:13:40,300
I'm not?
But I don't realize it

154
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:46,900
Indeed, Shou!
We really ought to thank Miss Ma

155
00:13:46,900 --> 00:13:51,900
She brings you luck. So long as
you're with her, you won't fall sick

156
00:13:52,300 --> 00:13:54,900
Oh, I can't be more pleased!

157
00:13:55,300 --> 00:14:02,100
Mother, if I continue to stick with her,
you'll soon have to hold a funeral!

158
00:14:04,300 --> 00:14:09,300
Don't spout nonsense! Just mix with her
more and you'll get used to it

159
00:14:09,300 --> 00:14:12,300
And you're not going to die.
That's for sure

160
00:14:12,300 --> 00:14:16,900
I don't want to get used to it!
Go on like this and I'll drop dead!

161
00:14:21,300 --> 00:14:24,300
Place your stake!

162
00:14:25,300 --> 00:14:29,300
It can't be "small" every time!
I'll stake on "big"!

163
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:32,300
1, 2, 3, small!

164
00:14:33,300 --> 00:14:35,300
I don't believe this!

165
00:14:35,300 --> 00:14:38,900
It's just not your day.
Come back another day

166
00:15:01,900 --> 00:15:03,900
You cheated?!

167
00:15:04,300 --> 00:15:05,900
Damn you!

168
00:15:06,300 --> 00:15:09,900
-What's going on?
-He lost and wants to beat me up!

169
00:15:11,300 --> 00:15:16,300
Good timing. He cheated.
Arrest him!

170
00:15:16,300 --> 00:15:19,300
-How much did he lose?
-10 wen

171
00:15:22,300 --> 00:15:23,300
Thanks!

172
00:15:23,300 --> 00:15:25,300
Are you crazy?

173
00:15:25,300 --> 00:15:28,900
Constable Ma has instructed us
to pay for all your losses

174
00:15:31,300 --> 00:15:35,300
Spicy woman, you actually ganged up
with some ruffian to cheat me!

175
00:15:35,300 --> 00:15:39,300
Why get so worked up?
It's no big deal to cheat

176
00:15:39,300 --> 00:15:42,100
Blame yourself for being stupid

177
00:15:42,300 --> 00:15:44,300
You can still be so sarcastic

178
00:15:44,300 --> 00:15:48,300
I was just quoting your mother. Looks
like there's some truth in her words

179
00:15:55,900 --> 00:15:59,900
Where are you burning my books?
I had a hard time getting them!

180
00:16:01,300 --> 00:16:05,900
Miss Ma says these dirty things
corrupt your mind!

181
00:16:06,300 --> 00:16:08,300
My treasures!

182
00:16:10,300 --> 00:16:13,900
Why can't you stop mentioning
Miss Ma?

183
00:16:16,300 --> 00:16:21,300
Because her money
is jingling in my pocket!

184
00:16:23,300 --> 00:16:29,300
Spicy woman, I hate you...!

185
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:35,900
How am I to face Father
and my buddies?

186
00:16:36,300 --> 00:16:42,900
And if those gossip mongers find out,
I'll lose face...

187
00:16:43,300 --> 00:16:46,300
That's why you're hiding here
like a coward?

188
00:16:52,300 --> 00:16:55,300
You again!
You just won't leave me alone!

189
00:16:57,300 --> 00:17:03,300
What were you doing behind my back?
How rude of you to eavesdrop on me!

190
00:17:03,300 --> 00:17:07,300
I wasn't eavesdropping.
I was already here before you came

191
00:17:09,300 --> 00:17:12,300
I don't believe you.
I've been here for days...

192
00:17:12,300 --> 00:17:14,300
Ah ha, you've owned up

193
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:20,300
You've been staying here since you came
back from the Capital? Dare not go home?

194
00:17:20,300 --> 00:17:24,300
Says who? You've got to be joking.
Make away!

195
00:17:25,300 --> 00:17:30,300
Not wanting to go home is different
from not having the guts to go home

196
00:17:31,300 --> 00:17:33,300
I thought you were scared

197
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:40,100
Indeed. Is there anything in this world
that I'd be sacred of?

198
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:42,100
Meeting your father is one

199
00:17:46,300 --> 00:17:48,300
Me, afraid of meeting my father?

200
00:17:50,100 --> 00:17:52,100
Why are you sitting here?
Get down

201
00:17:53,300 --> 00:17:54,900
Get down

202
00:17:57,300 --> 00:17:59,900
This is my bed.
Why are you lying on it?

203
00:18:19,300 --> 00:18:22,900
Forget it.
I won't fight with you

204
00:18:24,300 --> 00:18:26,300
What were you saying just now?

205
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:28,900
That you were afraid of
seeing your father

206
00:18:28,900 --> 00:18:33,900
What a joke! Have you ever heard of
a son being afraid of meeting his father?

207
00:18:33,900 --> 00:18:35,900
What about your buddies?

208
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:41,300
Do you know how close we are?

209
00:18:41,300 --> 00:18:47,100
We grew up together and share weal and
woe. Would I be afraid of seeing them?

210
00:18:48,300 --> 00:18:52,300
What about the gossip mongers then?
They always talk behind others' backs

211
00:18:53,300 --> 00:18:57,300
Let me tell you who the gossip mongers
are! They're some ignorant women!

212
00:18:57,300 --> 00:19:00,300
Would I let myself be bothered by
what they say?

213
00:19:00,300 --> 00:19:04,300
So why are you hiding here
like a coward then?

214
00:19:08,300 --> 00:19:11,300
Get this straight.
I'm not hiding

215
00:19:12,300 --> 00:19:17,300
I'm actually on a holiday here.
This place is quiet

216
00:19:17,300 --> 00:19:21,300
I'm just pondering over...

217
00:19:22,300 --> 00:19:25,300
the mistakes I've made
since I was a child

218
00:19:26,300 --> 00:19:28,900
I didn't know you made mistakes

219
00:19:30,900 --> 00:19:34,900
It's common for a man of letters
to be unrecognized for his talent

220
00:19:34,900 --> 00:19:39,300
Would I let a single exam
get me down?

221
00:19:39,300 --> 00:19:43,300
Confucius wrote Spring And Autumn Annals
only after he was trapped in Chencai

222
00:19:43,300 --> 00:19:46,900
Qu Yuan wrote Li Sao only after
he was sent into exile

223
00:19:46,900 --> 00:19:50,300
And Sima Qian wrote Shi Ji
only after he was castrated

224
00:19:50,300 --> 00:19:54,900
So many literati suffered
before they made their mark

225
00:19:55,300 --> 00:20:00,900
Would I take such a small setback
to heart?

226
00:20:00,900 --> 00:20:02,900
Where are you going?

227
00:20:03,300 --> 00:20:07,300
Home.
Does it bother you?

228
00:20:08,300 --> 00:20:12,900
I'll tell my father the exam system
is to blame, not me

229
00:20:13,900 --> 00:20:18,900
And let me tell you. I'm going to
have a drink with my buddies

230
00:20:18,900 --> 00:20:20,900
So stop following me

231
00:20:24,300 --> 00:20:27,300
Let's talk about the three of us

232
00:20:27,300 --> 00:20:32,900
We're kindhearted, adorable
and good-looking

233
00:20:32,900 --> 00:20:37,900
Why doesn't anybody like us?
Why does everybody speak ill of us?

234
00:20:37,900 --> 00:20:43,900
Why are we looked down upon
and trampled on?

235
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:56,000
I know of a place where we'll be
respected and treated like kings

236
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:58,400
Is there such a place?

237
00:20:59,300 --> 00:21:00,700
Trust me

238
00:21:00,700 --> 00:21:03,300
-Where is it?
-Take my word for it

239
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:09,300
Serve the guest well, all right?

240
00:21:11,300 --> 00:21:13,300
How is it?

241
00:21:16,700 --> 00:21:18,700
Long time no see!

242
00:21:21,700 --> 00:21:25,300
Enough talking!
Let's have a game of dice!

243
00:21:25,300 --> 00:21:30,300
-The loser will have to drink
-No. He or she will have to strip!

244
00:21:32,700 --> 00:21:33,700
Yummy

245
00:21:44,700 --> 00:21:45,700
Great!

246
00:21:46,700 --> 00:21:48,700
Looking for someone, Miss?

247
00:21:48,700 --> 00:21:50,700
What place is this?

248
00:21:51,700 --> 00:21:53,700
Somewhere you'll find pleasure!

249
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:57,700
-Pleasure?
-You'll feel like an immortal

250
00:21:57,700 --> 00:22:02,700
Really? Can you attain that level
in the mortal world?

251
00:22:03,300 --> 00:22:08,300
You're lucky to have run into me.
Tell me how much you want

252
00:22:09,500 --> 00:22:11,500
How is this old man related to you?

253
00:22:13,700 --> 00:22:18,300
I'm Zhang Guolao. Though I'm not riding
a donkey, I'm still Zhang Guolao

254
00:22:19,700 --> 00:22:22,700
Ma-gu, he takes you for a prostitute

255
00:22:28,700 --> 00:22:31,700
They're such a letdown!
I'll fix them!

256
00:22:32,300 --> 00:22:37,300
Listen to me first!
Cool down or you'll get wrinkles!

257
00:22:39,300 --> 00:22:43,700
How do you expect me to cool down?
They're abandoning themselves to vice

258
00:22:43,700 --> 00:22:46,700
Who can save them?

259
00:22:46,700 --> 00:22:49,300
You're the only one who can do it

260
00:22:53,700 --> 00:22:57,300
Make way!
What do you think you're doing?!

261
00:23:01,700 --> 00:23:05,300
You've got a new girl here...?

262
00:23:09,300 --> 00:23:11,300
I think it's her...

263
00:23:13,700 --> 00:23:17,700
Yeah, you're that lady constable.
What are you doing here...?

264
00:23:18,700 --> 00:23:22,700
I must say you're an all-rounder.
Let me have a kiss...

265
00:23:23,700 --> 00:23:27,700
What a pool of talent
they've got here

266
00:23:27,700 --> 00:23:30,700
Even the lady constable is here
to moonlight

267
00:23:32,700 --> 00:23:36,700
Shou, she isn't one of the girls

268
00:23:36,700 --> 00:23:39,700
The girls here are all very gentle,
unlike her

269
00:23:40,300 --> 00:23:43,300
You're my mother...

270
00:23:44,700 --> 00:23:48,300
No, she's your teacher

271
00:23:48,700 --> 00:23:56,300
Teachers aren't so unreasonable.
She's the procuress here...

272
00:24:45,700 --> 00:24:50,700
I'm so sick all because of that woman.
I must get even with her!

273
00:24:51,500 --> 00:24:54,500
Didn't you say your mother
quite liked her?

274
00:24:54,500 --> 00:24:58,500
Why not marry her?
You can torture her then

275
00:24:58,500 --> 00:25:01,500
Precisely. If you don't go to hell,
who else would?

276
00:25:01,700 --> 00:25:07,300
Why should I sacrifice myself?
Why don't you marry her instead?

277
00:25:07,300 --> 00:25:13,300
You're kidding. I already have
a wily mother. Do you want me dead?

278
00:25:14,700 --> 00:25:18,300
You won't marry her.
Why don't you do it then?

279
00:25:19,700 --> 00:25:24,700
You can't be serious.
Is she good enough for a man like me?

280
00:25:24,700 --> 00:25:27,300
So are we not going to take revenge?

281
00:25:27,300 --> 00:25:31,300
Of course we are!
I can't take the insult lying down!

282
00:25:31,700 --> 00:25:33,700
How will you seek revenge?

283
00:25:34,700 --> 00:25:36,700
-I've got it
-What?

284
00:25:36,700 --> 00:25:43,300
We find a woman 10 times
prettier and better than her

285
00:25:43,700 --> 00:25:46,700
If the woman is prettier than her,

286
00:25:46,700 --> 00:25:50,700
however spicy she is,
she won't be able to take it

287
00:25:50,700 --> 00:25:56,700
That's right! Didn't she once tell us
to find a woman more capable than her?

288
00:25:56,700 --> 00:26:00,700
We'll do just that. We'll find
a woman who surpasses her

289
00:26:00,700 --> 00:26:06,300
We'll make her mad, jealous, feel
inferior and be ashamed of herself!

290
00:26:06,300 --> 00:26:07,300
Agreed?

291
00:26:07,700 --> 00:26:12,300
Let's look for the perfect woman!

292
00:26:12,700 --> 00:26:15,300
-What's the big news?
-Let him finish

293
00:26:15,700 --> 00:26:18,700
Princess Ruining is coming here
to offer prayers

294
00:26:18,700 --> 00:26:22,700
Say, do our deities here
answer prayers?

295
00:26:22,700 --> 00:26:28,300
Sure! Our temple's name has spread
so far as the Capital!

296
00:26:28,700 --> 00:26:31,700
When the Princess come,
I'll sell her some rouge!

297
00:26:32,700 --> 00:26:36,700
Country bumpkins will be
country bumpkins

298
00:26:36,700 --> 00:26:42,700
The Princess is a royal.
Will you get to see her?

299
00:26:43,700 --> 00:26:45,700
Are you fit to see her then?

300
00:27:25,700 --> 00:27:31,300
Heaven, Earth, and all deities of
Ping'an Town, I'm offering you prayers

301
00:27:31,700 --> 00:27:36,300
Please see that my father
enjoys good health and longevity,

302
00:27:36,300 --> 00:27:40,300
and the kingdom,
peace and prosperity

303
00:28:44,700 --> 00:28:46,300
Assassins!

304
00:28:46,500 --> 00:28:47,700
Get them!

305
00:28:55,700 --> 00:28:58,700
How dare you try to harm Her Highness!
Take them away!

306
00:28:59,700 --> 00:29:01,300
Wait!

307
00:29:03,700 --> 00:29:05,300
Hold it!

308
00:29:06,300 --> 00:29:08,300
It's you, Miss Ma!

309
00:29:08,300 --> 00:29:13,700
I was secretly informed by the imperial
court that Her Highness would be coming

310
00:29:13,700 --> 00:29:15,700
So I came to protect her

311
00:29:15,700 --> 00:29:21,300
Since you're a renowned constable,
you must've been assigned important tasks

312
00:29:21,700 --> 00:29:26,700
Indeed. His Majesty was worried, so he
got me to protect Her Highness secretly

313
00:29:26,700 --> 00:29:28,700
Then they...

314
00:29:28,700 --> 00:29:32,700
They're just my subordinates
who work for me

315
00:29:33,700 --> 00:29:39,300
I see. So ultimately,
we're all serving the same purpose

316
00:29:39,700 --> 00:29:42,700
This is all a misunderstanding,
Your Highness

317
00:29:42,700 --> 00:29:48,700
Miss Ma is Golden Swallow, whom
His Majesty has sent to protect you

318
00:29:48,700 --> 00:29:49,700
Golden Swallow?

319
00:29:51,700 --> 00:29:54,700
With her protecting you,
your safety is guaranteed

320
00:29:54,700 --> 00:29:58,300
I'm tired, Magistrate Shi.
Let's return to your office

321
00:29:58,300 --> 00:29:59,700
Certainly

322
00:30:09,500 --> 00:30:12,500
Why can't you do anything right?!

323
00:30:12,500 --> 00:30:13,700
She's gone!

324
00:30:14,700 --> 00:30:16,700
Oh no...!

325
00:30:16,700 --> 00:30:20,700
Who we want to see is gone, and who
we don't want to see clings on to us

326
00:30:20,700 --> 00:30:23,300
Please spare us!

327
00:30:23,700 --> 00:30:28,300
I saved your lives,
yet you find me a nuisance

328
00:30:29,700 --> 00:30:32,700
Can you just stay out of our affairs?

329
00:30:32,700 --> 00:30:37,300
No way! I must interfere in all your
affairs because our fates are linked!

330
00:30:38,700 --> 00:30:40,300
Wretched woman!

331
00:30:41,700 --> 00:30:44,300
-Did you see the Princess?
-Yes, I did!

332
00:30:44,300 --> 00:30:46,300
-What did you see?
-Her bum

333
00:30:47,500 --> 00:30:49,500
-You?
-No

334
00:30:49,500 --> 00:30:55,500
There was some smoke, and the next
thing I knew, I was on the floor

335
00:30:58,300 --> 00:31:01,300
My sister Ma-gu!

336
00:31:01,700 --> 00:31:04,300
I've come to see you!

337
00:31:05,700 --> 00:31:10,700
I specially brought you
a peach from Heaven

338
00:31:10,700 --> 00:31:12,700
You miss Heaven, don't you?

339
00:31:13,700 --> 00:31:17,300
You won't even take a look?
What's the matter with you?

340
00:31:17,700 --> 00:31:21,700
Those 3 stooges are getting
bolder and bolder

341
00:31:21,700 --> 00:31:25,700
They actually tried to peek at
the Princess and were nearly...

342
00:31:25,700 --> 00:31:28,300
taken for assassins and beheaded

343
00:31:28,700 --> 00:31:33,700
Needless to say,
you must've saved them again

344
00:31:34,700 --> 00:31:38,700
No freckles on your face this time.
Isn't that good?

345
00:31:38,700 --> 00:31:43,300
I only managed to get out of the fix
by becoming the Princess' bodyguard

346
00:31:43,700 --> 00:31:46,700
What? You've become
the Princess' bodyguard?

347
00:31:47,700 --> 00:31:53,700
I came down to help the Trio and
ended up becoming a constable. Fine!

348
00:31:53,700 --> 00:31:58,700
Now I even have to protect the Princess.
Am I the thousand-arm Goddess of Mercy?

349
00:31:58,700 --> 00:32:02,300
If this go on, I'll die of exhaustion
before the Trio return to Heaven

350
00:32:03,700 --> 00:32:08,500
You're grumbling because of such a small
matter? Surely things aren't so bad?

351
00:32:08,700 --> 00:32:11,700
Those 3 stooges are still
good-for-nothings

352
00:32:11,700 --> 00:32:15,300
I doubt they can return to Heaven
before they're 30

353
00:32:15,700 --> 00:32:19,700
With you to help them,
things will be different

354
00:32:19,700 --> 00:32:25,700
If they still can't return with
your help, someone's going to lose face

355
00:32:29,300 --> 00:32:32,300
It's all your fault I'm in this fix!

356
00:32:32,300 --> 00:32:37,300
I might complain to the Jade Emperor
and have you demoted to a mortal!

357
00:32:39,700 --> 00:32:43,300
Can you stop going round and round
in the same direction? I'm giddy!

358
00:32:43,700 --> 00:32:48,700
You've vent your frustration.
If there's nothing else, I'll be going

359
00:32:51,700 --> 00:32:52,700
Yes?

360
00:32:52,700 --> 00:32:54,700
-I have something to ask you
-What is it?

361
00:32:56,700 --> 00:33:00,300
Who is prettier - the Princess or me?

362
00:33:03,700 --> 00:33:06,500
Need you ask?
Of course the Princess is pretty

363
00:33:06,500 --> 00:33:07,500
What!

364
00:33:07,500 --> 00:33:09,500
But she can't hold a candle to you!

365
00:33:09,700 --> 00:33:12,700
I don't believe you...

366
00:33:13,700 --> 00:33:17,300
Oh, come on!
Go look at yourself in the mirror

367
00:33:19,700 --> 00:33:22,300
Satisfied?
Can I go now?

368
00:33:27,700 --> 00:33:33,300
Don't forget to bring me Yurong Paste
from Chang E next time!

369
00:33:42,700 --> 00:33:44,700
Marquis, you're here

370
00:33:44,700 --> 00:33:49,300
It's been many years. Why must you
be difficult with me again?

371
00:33:49,300 --> 00:33:53,700
Don't try to plead for mercy. You were
Ouyang Xiaotian then, and I, Merciless

372
00:33:53,700 --> 00:33:57,700
You may have become a marquis now,
but I'm not going to let you off

373
00:33:57,700 --> 00:34:00,700
Your Highness haven't changed at all

374
00:34:00,700 --> 00:34:02,300
Please sit

375
00:34:06,700 --> 00:34:09,700
Can I see your face, Your Highness?

376
00:34:09,700 --> 00:34:14,500
Wait! I need to test you first.
If you fail, you can't see me

377
00:34:14,500 --> 00:34:15,500
Fine

378
00:34:18,700 --> 00:34:20,700
What a spread

379
00:34:20,700 --> 00:34:22,700
The test starts now

380
00:34:31,700 --> 00:34:37,700
This is barbecued mutton
Xiaohei prepared. It's succulent

381
00:34:43,700 --> 00:34:48,500
Delicious! It's been a long time
since I last had such tasty dumplings

382
00:34:49,300 --> 00:34:51,300
You can even tell that?

383
00:35:09,700 --> 00:35:12,700
-Do you admit defeat?
-When did I lose?

384
00:35:12,700 --> 00:35:17,700
Well, that was chilli,
but you said, "Wah!"

385
00:35:17,700 --> 00:35:20,700
You played a prank on me

386
00:35:21,300 --> 00:35:26,300
No, I didn't. It was food I put
in your mouth. Do you admit defeat?

387
00:35:26,300 --> 00:35:28,300
All right, I lost

388
00:35:28,300 --> 00:35:30,300
In your heart, do you admit defeat?

389
00:35:30,300 --> 00:35:33,300
Yes, since I managed to
make Your Highness smile

390
00:35:33,300 --> 00:35:36,300
You should know I dislike people
who don't mean what they say

391
00:35:36,300 --> 00:35:38,300
Do you think I'm that sort?

392
00:35:38,700 --> 00:35:44,300
I'm not sure. It's been so many years.
Besides, I can't read your mind

393
00:35:44,700 --> 00:35:50,300
What must I do
to convince you then?

394
00:35:50,700 --> 00:35:54,300
Eat up all the chilli
and I'll believe you

395
00:35:56,500 --> 00:35:57,500
All right

396
00:36:22,700 --> 00:36:24,700
Some tea this is!
It tastes awful!

397
00:36:25,700 --> 00:36:30,700
Your Highness, we're away
from the Palace. Please make do

398
00:36:30,700 --> 00:36:34,300
No. I want Longjing tea from Hangzhou.
Go prepare it

399
00:36:34,300 --> 00:36:36,700
Aren't you making things
difficult for me?

400
00:36:36,700 --> 00:36:41,700
Why are you so stupid? Somewhere is
bound to have the tea leaves I want

401
00:36:41,700 --> 00:36:44,700
How could I have forgotten
the Marquis' residence?

402
00:36:44,700 --> 00:36:49,700
Your Highness, you should've told me
straight you wanted tea from the Marquis

403
00:36:49,700 --> 00:36:51,700
Why talk in a roundabout way?

404
00:36:51,700 --> 00:36:54,300
Be quiet or I'll get Golden Swallow
to slap you

405
00:36:54,300 --> 00:37:00,700
All right, I'll shut up. Talking about
Golden Swallow, I find her rather weird

406
00:37:00,700 --> 00:37:05,300
She's always wearing a veil. Have you
seen her looks, Your Highness?

407
00:37:05,700 --> 00:37:09,700
Some years ago, she appeared
for the first time and cracked...

408
00:37:09,700 --> 00:37:11,700
a lost treasure case for Father

409
00:37:11,700 --> 00:37:15,700
Father was so pleased he threw
a banquet at Zhaoyang Palace

410
00:37:15,700 --> 00:37:20,700
Golden Swallow turned up,
but she still had her veil on

411
00:37:20,700 --> 00:37:28,300
After a few drinks, she took off
her veil upon Father's request

412
00:37:43,700 --> 00:37:46,700
In that case,
you've never seen her face?

413
00:37:46,700 --> 00:37:49,700
No.
I didn't expect to see her here

414
00:37:49,700 --> 00:37:53,300
Given her skills,
she's indeed the No 1 Constable

415
00:37:54,700 --> 00:37:57,300
Miss Ma, please come!

416
00:37:59,700 --> 00:38:01,700
We've been waiting for you!

417
00:38:02,300 --> 00:38:06,300
Why aren't you avoiding me today?
Not afraid I might scold you?

418
00:38:07,700 --> 00:38:10,700
Don't make us feel
we're strangers

419
00:38:10,700 --> 00:38:14,700
You have our interests at heart.
We really appreciate that

420
00:38:14,700 --> 00:38:15,700
Right

421
00:38:15,700 --> 00:38:19,700
Miss Ma, a day without training
seems as long as 3 years

422
00:38:19,700 --> 00:38:22,700
We're here to seek
your guidance today

423
00:38:22,700 --> 00:38:23,700
Right

424
00:38:24,700 --> 00:38:27,300
Why are you changed overnight?

425
00:38:27,700 --> 00:38:31,700
Miss Ma, do you think
we look like imperial guards?

426
00:38:31,700 --> 00:38:33,700
Aren't we awe-inspiring!

427
00:38:33,700 --> 00:38:36,300
We can pass off as them, can't we?

428
00:38:39,700 --> 00:38:43,300
Thinking of posing as my men
to see Her Highness?

429
00:38:43,700 --> 00:38:47,700
The other time, didn't you say
we were your subordinates?

430
00:38:47,700 --> 00:38:52,300
How can you go back on your word?

431
00:38:56,700 --> 00:38:58,700
Put me down...!

432
00:39:00,700 --> 00:39:01,700
Her Highness!

433
00:39:17,700 --> 00:39:21,700
You'd better not behave sneakily.
You're now guards of Her Highness

434
00:39:21,700 --> 00:39:25,100
-Don't block my view
-Don't ruin my reputation

435
00:39:25,700 --> 00:39:28,700
That's where you're wrong

436
00:39:28,700 --> 00:39:33,700
If we don't observe Her Highness,
we wouldn't know who might harm her

437
00:39:47,700 --> 00:39:50,700
A fairy from Heaven!

438
00:39:51,700 --> 00:39:55,300
Have you ever seen a fairy
from Heaven? Don't talk rot!

439
00:39:55,300 --> 00:40:00,300
How extraordinary! Those girls at the
brothel can't hold a candle to her!

440
00:40:00,700 --> 00:40:06,500
How can you compare them
to Her Highness?

441
00:40:06,500 --> 00:40:09,500
You're right.
I shouldn't do that. My fault

442
00:40:09,700 --> 00:40:13,700
If I could spend the 15th day of the
1st lunar month with Her Highness,

443
00:40:13,700 --> 00:40:15,700
I wouldn't mind shortening my life

444
00:40:15,700 --> 00:40:17,700
Same here...

445
00:40:17,700 --> 00:40:21,700
Come on, she's only a woman

446
00:40:21,700 --> 00:40:24,700
You won't understand, tomboy!

447
00:40:25,700 --> 00:40:30,700
Actually, it's not that difficult
to spend the festival with her

448
00:40:30,700 --> 00:40:31,700
Really?

449
00:40:31,700 --> 00:40:35,700
Don't brag! You should count your
lucky stars if you could...

450
00:40:35,700 --> 00:40:40,700
say a few words to her, not to mention
spend a festival with her

451
00:40:41,700 --> 00:40:45,300
-Want to make a bet?
-You're on!

452
00:40:45,700 --> 00:40:50,700
All right, I bet you that I'll be
able to talk to Her Highness

453
00:40:50,700 --> 00:40:52,700
What if you lose?

454
00:40:52,700 --> 00:40:55,700
If l lose, we'll go to Fengyue Tang

455
00:40:59,700 --> 00:41:01,700
It's Ouyang Xiaotian!

456
00:41:19,700 --> 00:41:22,300
What are you people doing here?

457
00:41:24,700 --> 00:41:27,300
We're here to protect Her Highness

458
00:41:27,700 --> 00:41:29,700
We're Her Highness' guards

459
00:41:30,300 --> 00:41:32,300
Protect Her Highness?

460
00:41:32,300 --> 00:41:36,700
They're sent by my father to
protect me. We've met at the temple

461
00:41:40,700 --> 00:41:42,700
Just stand there then

462
00:41:42,700 --> 00:41:44,500
What now?

463
00:41:46,700 --> 00:41:50,700
Knowing you love paintings, I've
gathered all the good works in town

464
00:41:50,700 --> 00:41:53,700
I also know you're
very much into Buddhism

465
00:41:53,700 --> 00:41:58,700
So I painted this, A Pond Of Lotuses,
for you. Do you like it?

466
00:41:59,700 --> 00:42:03,700
You really know me.
Let me admire your work

467
00:42:05,700 --> 00:42:10,700
Lotuses and the Heart Sutra.
You must've put in a lot of effort

468
00:42:11,700 --> 00:42:14,700
-A pity!
-What is a pity?

469
00:42:15,700 --> 00:42:17,700
What are your views?

470
00:42:17,700 --> 00:42:21,700
Lotuses emerge unsullied
from the filth

471
00:42:21,700 --> 00:42:25,700
They should be elegant and graceful

472
00:42:25,700 --> 00:42:29,700
But the lotuses in this painting
lack those features

473
00:42:29,700 --> 00:42:33,700
In fact, they're contending
with each other for beauty

474
00:42:35,700 --> 00:42:40,700
It's a nice painting, but there isn't
a touch of Buddhism in it

475
00:42:40,700 --> 00:42:44,700
There's the Heart Sutra in the painting.
It and the lotuses compliment each other

476
00:42:44,700 --> 00:42:46,700
It's an excellent piece of work!

477
00:42:47,700 --> 00:42:50,700
Fine, but what is the Heart Sutra?

478
00:42:51,700 --> 00:42:56,700
Though it has only about 260 characters,
it's a summary of prajna

479
00:42:56,700 --> 00:43:00,700
It uses the wisdom of prajna
to free oneself from all worries

480
00:43:00,700 --> 00:43:05,300
That's why its full name is
Prajnaparamita Hrdaya Sutra

481
00:43:06,700 --> 00:43:11,700
This painting of lotuses is trying to
depict voidness and pureness

482
00:43:11,700 --> 00:43:16,700
But the artist filled
all the empty space with the sutra

483
00:43:16,700 --> 00:43:20,300
That doesn't agree with
the image of lotuses

484
00:43:20,300 --> 00:43:25,300
It totally defeats the purpose
of painting them

485
00:43:25,300 --> 00:43:28,300
Golden Swallow,
take your subordinate in hand!

486
00:43:31,700 --> 00:43:33,700
Be quiet!

487
00:43:34,700 --> 00:43:40,300
We all have our preferences.
Let's not argue anymore. How boring!

488
00:43:40,700 --> 00:43:43,300
Can you do me a favour?

489
00:43:43,700 --> 00:43:44,700
What is it?

490
00:43:44,700 --> 00:43:48,700
Since you left the Capital,
I haven't seen your superb skills

491
00:43:49,700 --> 00:43:53,500
My bodyguard, Golden Swallow,
is the No 1 lady constable

492
00:43:53,500 --> 00:43:56,500
Can you exchange pointers
for me to see?

493
00:43:59,700 --> 00:44:01,700
No problem

494
00:44:02,500 --> 00:44:04,500
Please pardon my poor skills

495
00:44:25,700 --> 00:44:27,700
Subtitled by S Lin


